HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The ssyymm driver provides support for the following Symbios/LSI Logic PCI
     SCSI controllers:

     ••   53C810
     ••   53C810A
     ••   53C815
     ••   53C825
     ••   53C825A
     ••   53C860
     ••   53C875
     ••   53C876
     ••   53C895
     ••   53C895A
     ••   53C896
     ••   53C897
     ••   53C1000
     ••   53C1000R
     ••   53C1010-33
     ••   53C1010-66
     ••   53C1510D

     The SCSI controllers supported by ssyymm can be either embedded on a mother‐
     board, or on one of the following add-on boards:

     ••   ASUS SC-200, SC-896
     ••   Data Technology DTC3130 (all variants)
     ••   DawiControl DC2976UW
     ••   Diamond FirePort (all)
     ••   NCR cards (all)
     ••   Symbios cards (all)
     ••   Tekram DC390W, 390U, 390F, 390U2B, 390U2W, 390U3D, and 390U3W
     ••   Tyan S1365

